   "titulo": "Frequency and progress",
   "texto": [
    "**her zaman** = always; **çoğu zaman** = most of the time; **hiçbir zaman** = never.",
    "To talk about an ongoing action, it retains the progressive present that you already know: **bu hafta çok çalışıyorum** = this week I am working hard.",
    "**ama** connects two opposite ideas: «but»."
   ]
